        "note": "This project reuses three Lean files authored by Jonathan Ho and vendored from this exact Lean Pool revision: Basic.lean, PrekopaLeindler.lean, and BrunnMinkowski.lean, stored locally as PrekopaLeindlerBasic.lean, PrekopaLeindler.lean, and BrunnMinkowski.lean. Ho's contribution is the formalization of the Prekopa-Leindler and Brunn-Minkowski analytic infrastructure used by this project. In particular, Correlation.lean uses `brunn_minkowski_fintype_toReal` in the proof of `section_root_concave`. The Hansen-polytope definitions, cograph recursion, Mahler argument, and final theorem are developed separately in this repository.",
